{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Il57MioTkc1794803058.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有分析相信，港股走勢將再下試低位，尤其是科網股業績，或為市場帶來震盪。</p><p></p><p>華富建業證券投資策略聯席總監阮子曦說：「大家最害怕的是，指數會否完全沒反彈，一直沽到底下試22,800點，我相信本周一些消息，有「三頭馬車」、有業績，也有中美俄峰會。除非破裂得很厲害，或美元再進一步大幅轉強，否則我們預計阿里巴巴及騰訊有震盪就算。大家也知道勢頭正向下，所以暫時來說不需要急於買貨。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:12:41.319282+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T04:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T05:06:07.811386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T05:06:07.811386+00:00","content_hash":"b18ad34b6373face40fd94a7c26022659cbf34a71a5ac7876a4fea8d5b177995","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}